background_color: "white"
header_color: "transparent"
---

<main role="main">

  <section class="lead-main" aria-label="Lead Eduction Group Hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="lead-main-inner">
        <div class="lead-main-text">
          <h1>Who We Are</h1>
          <p>LEAD Education Group believes that education is a primary means to future success for individuals, societies and for entire nations.</p>
          <p>Through the vehicle of international schools, students are given opportunity to become successful and influential leaders who will promote systemic and positive change in their societies and nations.</p>
        </div>
        <%= image_tag 'sfax-kids.jpg', class: 'lead-main-image' %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="second" class="margin-top-90">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 banner-d-flex">
          <div class="inner-text center">
            <p class="top-accent-text">Special Focus</p>
            <h3>A statement from our Executive Director</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="executive-director-container">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12 banner-d-flex">
            <div class="executive-director">
              <%= image_tag 'businessman.jpg', class: 'Stephen-Beck', alt: 'Stephen Beck, Ph.D.' %>
              <div>
                <p><strong>Stephen Beck, Ph.D.</strong></p>
                <p>Executive Director</p>
                <p>LEAD Education Group, Inc.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-very-light-blue">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="statement">
          <div class="inner-text">
            <p>After years of placing English speaking teachers in national schools, tutoring, teaching English and giving teacher training seminars, a successful businessman asked me, “What one thing do you consider would be the most impactful in your work overseas?” Immediately, I responded, “Start international schools.”</p>

            <p>I explained that students who attend international schools come from influential families and that these students can be expected to be future leaders. When you start your own school, you can set much higher standards than if you work in a school owned by someone else. Furthermore, parents want their children to be successful and they understand that an international education in English is the most assured pathway to future success.</p>

            <p>So, we in LEAD Education began focusing our efforts on starting international schools. Our vision it to create model schools that can be scaled and reproduced in other countries while all the time remembering that each school location is unique.</p>
            <p>Starting new schools is a challenging endeavor. However, we are committed to starting and developing international schools of distinction.  Schools that parents and children will be proud of and that result in lasting and beneficial change in the lives of individuals, societies and countries.</p>

            <p>We welcome you to join us in the adventure ahead!</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

